{"id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-reflection-principle.md","title":"按公式类限制的统一反射模式","display":"df-reflection-principle — 按公式类限制的统一反射模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-reflection-principle","aliases":["91-df-reflection-principle","91-df-RFN"],"display":"df-reflection-principle — 按公式类限制的统一反射模式","depends_on":["[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-reflection-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-reflection-principle</span><span>91-df-RFN</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflection-principle — 按公式类限制的统一反射模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是可递归公理化的算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prov}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Prov}_S\\)</span> 是标准可证性谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x)\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x)\\)</span> 已列出全部自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(a,\\vec n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(a,\\vec n)\\)</span> 为逐个数字代入编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\)</span> 是下述句子模式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}\\)</span> 为反射记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,[\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)]:\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,[\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)]:\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对每个标准公式给出的模式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\)</span> 是对象数变量的全称量化。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 含矛盾句，模式有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner0=1\\urcorner})\\to0=1\">\\(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner0=1\\urcorner})\\to0=1\\)</span> 这一实例，基础算术据此推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>。任意受限公式类没有自动的这一后果。\n局部反射只对无自由变量的句子列出实例；统一反射是本模式取全公式类；全局反射则借助 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 压缩为一个代码量化句。UTB 加全局反射可推出统一反射，UTB 单独不能。</p>\n<p>来源：§22.1–22.2，印刷页 308–313。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(a,\\vec n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,[\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)]:\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner0=1\\urcorner})\\to0=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1704,"backlinks":[{"id":"0bb5ccbcd92bda96","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2126873bea8294ae","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$、$\\mathcal L_S$ 及 $\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)$ 的数字代入约定见 [[91-df-reflection-principle]]。"},{"id":"14209f87e5536e32","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6dbd30f084c7a7cd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-